ArmCpu: an [ev] line (weak boot_progress_stage) per secondary step: ml_processor_register, CPU_ON call + rc, initCPU on the new core,
GICR wake (frame, WAKER), GIC on, timer/running, first IPI per core, parked reasons, processor_start rc. Apply in drivers/ArmCpu with -p1.

--- a/ArmCpu.cpp	2026-11-26 18:31:45.484076724 +0530
+++ b/ArmCpu.cpp	2026-11-26 18:34:52.850134110 +0530
